# Keep the relayer image context minimal: workspace manifests + the three
# packages the build needs. Everything secret or irrelevant stays out.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages
packages/*
!packages/types
!packages/sdk
!apps
apps/*
!apps/relayer

# Never ship env files, deps, builds, or local state even from included dirs
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.log
